Solution:
Use the Product Rule twice.
\begin{array}{rcl} f'(x) \amp =\amp x^{-9} \cdot \frac{d}{dx}[ e^x \cot x] + \frac{d}{dx}[ x^{-9} ] \cdot (e^x \cot x) \\ \amp =\amp x^{-9}\left( e^x \frac{d}{dx}[ \cot x ] + \frac{d}{dx}[e^x] \cot x \right) - 9 x^{-10} (e^x \cot x) \\ \amp =\amp x^{-9} (e^x( -\csc^2 x) + e^x \cot x) - 9 x^{-10} e^x \cot x \\ \amp =\amp x^{-9} e^x( -\csc^2 x) + x^{-9} e^x \cot x - 9 x^{-10} e^x \cot x \\ \end{array}
